Rebase cadence
--------------

Rebase on each upstream release. The entire local delta is captured in
patches/0001-atspi44-compat.patch, so a rebase is:

  1. replace vendor/agent-desktop/crates/{core,linux} with the new tag;
  2. apply patches/0001-atspi44-compat.patch;
  3. run `make desktop-test` and the calculator dogfood.
